{
  "an4.236:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.236 ",
  "an4.236:0.2": "24. Kammavagga ",
  "an4.236:0.3": "Dutiyasikkhāpadasutta ",
  "an4.236:1.1": "“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, kammāni mayā sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā paveditāni. ",
  "an4.236:1.2": "Katamāni cattāri? ",
  "an4.236:1.3": "Atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhaṁ kaṇhavipākaṁ; ",
  "an4.236:1.4": "atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ sukkaṁ sukkavipākaṁ; ",
  "an4.236:1.5": "atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhasukkaṁ kaṇhasukkavipākaṁ; ",
  "an4.236:1.6": "atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ akaṇhaasukkaṁ akaṇhaasukkavipākaṁ kammakkhayāya saṁvattati. ",
  "an4.236:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhaṁ kaṇhavipākaṁ? ",
  "an4.236:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekaccena mātā jīvitā voropitā hoti, pitā jīvitā voropito hoti, arahaṁ jīvitā voropito hoti, tathāgatassa duṭṭhena cittena lohitaṁ uppāditaṁ hoti, saṅgho bhinno hoti. ",
  "an4.236:2.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhaṁ kaṇhavipākaṁ. ",
  "an4.236:3.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, kammaṁ sukkaṁ sukkavipākaṁ? ",
  "an4.236:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco pāṇātipātā paṭivirato hoti, adinnādānā paṭivirato hoti, kāmesumicchācārā paṭivirato hoti, musāvādā paṭivirato hoti, pisuṇāya vācāya paṭivirato hoti, pharusāya vācāya paṭivirato hoti, samphappalāpā paṭivirato hoti, anabhijjhālu hoti, abyāpannacitto hoti, sammādiṭṭhi hoti. ",
  "an4.236:3.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, kammaṁ s